'''''Dendrobium''''' section '''''Distichophyllae''''' is a section of the genus ''[[Dendrobium]]''.<ref name="Tropicos">{{cite web | title=Tropicos | website=Tropicos | url=https://www.tropicos.org/name/100352783 | access-date=2022-04-04}}</ref>

==Description==
Plants in this section have short creeping [[rhizome]]s, rigid straight leaves, and one or more solitary flowers.<ref name="Orchids of New Guinea">{{cite web | title=Largest online collection of New Guinea orchids | website=Orchids of New Guinea | url=http://www.orchidsnewguinea.com/ | access-date=2022-05-29}}</ref>

==Distribution==
Plants from this section are found from [[China]], to [[Southeast Asia]], [[Australia]], and [[New Guinea]].<ref name="eFloras.org Home">{{cite web | title=Dendrobium sect. Distichophylla in Flora of China @ efloras.org | website=eFloras.org Home | url=http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=135452 | access-date=2022-05-29}}</ref>

